{"id":"bf469772e5a6dfb0","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-closed-bounded.md","title":"Closed Bounded Set","display":"df-closed-bounded — Closed Bounded Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closed-bounded","aliases":["58-df-closed-bounded","Closed Bounded Set"],"display":"df-closed-bounded — Closed Bounded Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-closed-set]]","[[58-df-bounded-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closed-bounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closed-bounded</span><span>Closed Bounded Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-bounded — Closed Bounded Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"58-df-closed-set\">58-df-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da71e16420fa5708\" href=\"?note=da71e16420fa5708\" title=\"58-df-bounded-set\">58-df-bounded-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> (dimension and subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_n\">\\(d_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n\">\\(\\tau_n\\)</span> (the Euclidean metric and its induced topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Closed}_S\\)</span> (closed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"58-df-closed-set\">58-df-closed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S\\)</span> (metric-boundedness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da71e16420fa5708\" href=\"?note=da71e16420fa5708\" title=\"58-df-bounded-set\">58-df-bounded-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S(A,n,d_n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(d_n(x,y)=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i&lt;n}(x_i-y_i)^2}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_n=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(d_n(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_n)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,d_n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S(A,n,d_n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(d_n(x,y)=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i&lt;n}(x_i-y_i)^2}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_n=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(d_n(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_n)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,d_n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Euclidean metric and topology are explicit arguments, so closedness and boundedness cannot silently refer to different ambient structures.</li>\n<li>Closed: limit points of the set are in the set; bounded: contained in some ball of finite radius.</li>\n<li>Compact in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>: closed and bounded</li>\n<li>Bolzano-Weierstrass: bounded infinite set has limit point</li>\n<li>Heine-Borel compactness is a theorem depending on this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-set","status":"resolved","id":"da71e16420fa5708","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Closed}_S$ (closed-set predicate, see [[58-df-closed-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-set","status":"resolved","id":"da71e16420fa5708","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S$ (metric-boundedness predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"d_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ClosedBoundedEuclidean}_S(A,n,d_n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(d_n(x,y)=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i<n}(x_i-y_i)^2}\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\tau_n=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(d_n(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_n)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,\\mathbb R^n,d_n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-closed-bounded.md|58-df-closed-bounded]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["3600401d4adbcbd4","da71e16420fa5708"]}